


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_30e3d11a:



    voice "2RI_0650"
    rin "「嗯嗯～～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_061adb19:


    "伦伸了个大懒腰，大概是读书暂告一段落。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_9aab9b49:



    voice "2MI_0532"
    miyako "「噢噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_1a435e48:


    "她只是普通地往后弯了下腰，但柔软的身段让这动作有了迫力，看起来像是瑜伽里的眼镜蛇式。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_926df739:



    voice "2HI_0640"
    hina "「很厉害吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_521c0980:



    voice "2MI_0533"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_255ecafa:


    "圣夜子模仿起伦的样子，但撑死也只能做到一半。并不是因为她身体僵硬，而是因为伦身体柔软。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ee68000a:



    voice "2RI_0651"
    rin "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_162e2ca8:



    voice "2HI_0641"
    hina "「我们在说伦的身体很软」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_8b0646c8:



    voice "2FU_0530"
    fumi "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_23308533:


    "这位的身子就很僵硬了。胸甚至离不开床。虽然也有特殊原因。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_5abbac59:



    voice "2HI_0642"
    hina "「伦以前是跳芭蕾的哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_6d07d469:



    voice "2MI_0534"
    miyako "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_52ec975e:



    voice "2RI_0652"
    rin "「很久之前就放弃了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_984913cf:



    voice "2HI_0643"
    hina "「听说是很有天赋的。如果继续下去，可能会成为有名的芭蕾舞蹈家吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_9397e652:



    voice "2MI_0535"
    miyako "「好厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_18ba0746:



    voice "2RI_0653"
    rin "「我迟早都会放弃的。因为缺乏毅力」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ca2de10a:



    voice "2HI_0644"
    hina "「又在说这种话了。伦太看不起自己了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_75fee5cd:



    voice "2RI_0654"
    rin "「是阳菜太看得起我了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_cca822ba:



    voice "2HI_0645"
    hina "「才没有！对了，伦你做一下那个！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_6aeed25e:



    voice "2RI_0655"
    rin "「那个是哪个？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_72cc6fa9:



    voice "2HI_0646"
    hina "「呃，就是单腿站立的同时抬起另一条腿的那个动作。叫什么阿拉哈吧克？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_a0f3b7c2:



    voice "2RI_0656"
    rin "「你是说阿拉贝斯克吧。我不想做」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_3adebbf4:



    voice "2HI_0647"
    hina "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_fbb2e4f3:



    voice "2RI_0657"
    rin "「因为麻烦。而且现在也很晚了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_b1326bbb:


    "伦转了个身面向了另一边。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_c6bb94cc:



    voice "2HI_0648"
    hina "「唔唔唔唔！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_e5d45cf5:


    "闹别扭模式开启了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_404e48fd:



    voice "2RI_0658"
    rin "「闹别扭也不行」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_0add55df:



    voice "2FU_0531"
    fumi "「啊，我也想看。圣夜子呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_f49402d7:



    voice "2MI_0536"
    miyako "「嗯，想看」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ca2424a8:


    "文伸出了援手,圣夜子迅速察觉了文的意图而附议。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_fbc461e4:



    voice "2HI_0649"
    hina "「唔唔唔唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ebf80a4b:



    voice "2RI_0659"
    rin "「唉。就做一下啊。动作幅度太大的我就不做了啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_64d1a578:


    "最终，伦还是折服了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_36cc55d2:



    voice "2HI_0650"
    hina "「太好啦～！很厉害的哦！大家都看仔细了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_f298072a:


    "说得就像要做的是自己一样。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_31a1e289:



    voice "2RI_0660RE"
    rin "「真是的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ddcbc0d1:


    "伦把书放到桌上，慢慢站起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_f63b83e7:


    "上下扭动身子进行最低限度的伸展运动，看上去已经很像是那么回事了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_b58d1a1f:


    "在伦热身期间，文抽开了桌子，腾出空间。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_d879a7ce:



    voice "2RI_0661B"
    rin "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_6f5aa083:


    "伦慢慢伸展背部，从头到脚呈一条直线。驼背的模样不复存在，伦的身高也因此被完全展现出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_1c2e1c5d:



    voice "2MI_0537"
    miyako "「哇！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_8b2b09cd:


    "光是看到伦优美的站姿，圣夜子就发出了感叹。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_9bde1f0a:



    voice "2HI_0651"
    hina "「你们看！腿的动作，很厉害的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_f7bf8e21:



    voice "2FU_0532"
    fumi "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_50ce35fd:


    "伦摆好姿势，踩着节拍重复着1～5的动作。这是她过去反复练习而形成的肢体记忆吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_82a506e0:



    voice "2HI_0652"
    hina "「接下来要注意看上半身。大家看，腿明明一直在动，但上半身完全没有摇晃」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_4f204a83:


    fumi_miyako "「真的诶！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_35b2ba24:



    voice "2RI_0662"
    rin "「……好难继续」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_bcec1937:



    voice "2HI_0653"
    hina "「别拉长着脸啦。表情更开心一点吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_bde29dd7:



    voice "2RI_0663"
    rin "「唉。接下来就是最后了，我要抬腿咯——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_4458f6c9:


    "再度叹气后，伦硬是挤出了笑容——虽然是苦笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_0d4ab8e4:


    "然后，她慢慢抬脚。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_2ee6d7d1:


    "虽然动作幅度没有之前那么大，但还是能体现她的四肢纤长，仿佛可以伸展到房间每个角落。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_9ed88b79:



    voice "2HI_0654"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_922023fc:


    "阳菜投向伦的目光里闪烁着憧憬。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_4ce9cdb8:



    voice "2HI_0655"
    hina "「我就是看到这个喜欢上伦的。所以伦的阿拉里诶克是我的宝物」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_e3aa64bb:



    voice "2FU_0534"
    fumi "「哇……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_e5835f96:



    voice "2MI_0539"
    miyako "「哦哦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_bb876247:


    "两人发出赞叹。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_a8219e45:


    "……说了是阿拉贝斯克，左耳进右耳出可还行。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_7055b06d:



    voice "2RI_0664"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_66b8139e:


    "然后，伦慢慢放下腿，宣布结束。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_93c2d7e8:



    voice "2MI_0540"
    miyako "「好美啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_fb15ea3c:



    voice "2RI_0665"
    rin "「谢啦。但以后就不做了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_49cb29de:



    voice "2FU_0535"
    fumi "「睡衣看上去都像是芭蕾舞裙了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_9519382c:



    voice "2RI_0666"
    rin "「没有没有。这只是伸展运动啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ee70959b:



    voice "2HI_0656"
    hina "「嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_3a4b2652:


    "阳菜照着伦的样子抬起脚，但她的身体不如伦柔软因此动作笨拙。看来运动神经在此是派不上用场了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_510ae4bb:



    voice "2RI_0667"
    rin "「啊，小心。连扶栏都没有初学者就别——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_31480181:



    voice "2HI_0657"
    hina "「哟、呀……呜啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_af7a9672:


    "不说做阿拉贝斯克了，连抬起一条腿都还没有做到就失去了平衡。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_1ce10954:



    voice "2RI_0668"
    rin "「嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_90037055:


    "伦赶紧伸出手，支撑住阳菜的身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_f5309de4:



    voice "2RI_0669"
    rin "「你在干什么啊，多危险啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_5105bd77:



    voice "2HI_0658"
    hina "「对不起……我想和伦一起跳」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_e847cb75:



    voice "2RI_0670"
    rin "「唉。不会跳的。我不擅长和别人一起跳」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_38adaafa:



    voice "2HI_0659"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_90e50606:



    voice "2RI_0671"
    rin "「好了，结束了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_4b312fb8:


    "伦松开泄气的阳菜的手后，又躺了回去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_40a95e02:


    "啪叽啪叽啪叽。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_ebb9f2fd:



    voice "2MI_0541"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_4b1b4585:



    voice "2FU_0536"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_02_22810e87:


    "圣夜子和文拍着手，看着对方。"
